# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🐉 Pokémon sprite cache — ~33 MB of Gen-5 BW animated PNGs
# fetched at runtime from PokéAPI / Showdown CDN. Don't bloat the
# repo: each contributor's `npm run fetch-pokedex` populates this
# locally, the service worker caches them per user.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
public/sprites/pokemon/
